{"id": "JAH-CONJOB-S-000001", "slug": "construction-jobs-signature", "title": "Construction Jobs — Signature Master Builder Path", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "construction job record", "ladder_rank": 1, "body": "Signature edition. Signature-original career concept. The Signature Master Builder Path is a single ladder that runs laborer to multi-trade master inside one career plan. Stages: (1) Foundation Year — labor plus OSHA 10 and tool basics; (2) Trade Year — full apprenticeship in one trade; (3) Second Trade Year — apprenticeship in a complementary trade (e.g., carpentry then electrical); (4) Lead Years — running crews in both trades; (5) Master Builder — licensed, estimating, and managing whole jobs. The Signature idea: two trades in one head ends the finger-pointing between trades. A Signature concept for study.", "capabilities": ["Map the five Signature stages", "Pair complementary trades", "List the Foundation Year credentials", "Explain the two-trades advantage", "Plan the Master Builder license step"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Signature path timeline", "code": "const total=C.stages.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0);assert(total===C.expected,'years');J({years_to_master:total});", "verified_output": "{\"years_to_master\":7}", "verified_at": "2026-10-22", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt items 137-145", "last_verified": "2026-10-22", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress", "marker": "march to a million: in progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true, "throttled": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Construction Jobs Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature Trade-Swap Program", "Signature Pay-Ladder Transparency"], "sibling_edition": "construction-jobs"}}
{"id": "JAH-CONJOB-S-000002", "slug": "construction-jobs-signature", "title": "Construction Jobs — Signature Trade-Swap Program", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "construction job record", "ladder_rank": 2, "body": "Signature edition. Signature-original career concept. The Signature Trade-Swap Program rotates apprentices through other trades for one month each so every worker understands the trades around them. A carpentry apprentice spends a month with the electricians, a month with the plumbers, and a month with the masons. The result: fewer conflicts in shared chases, cleaner handoffs, and apprentices who choose their final trade with open eyes. A Signature concept for study.", "capabilities": ["Schedule the three swap months", "List what each swap teaches", "Measure conflict reduction", "Guide apprentices choosing a trade", "Run the swap debrief"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Signature swap scheduler", "code": "const total=C.trades.length*C.months_each;assert(total===C.expected,'months');J({swap_months:total,trades:C.trades});", "verified_output": "{\"swap_months\":3,\"trades\":[\"electrical\",\"plumbing\",\"masonry\"]}", "verified_at": "2026-10-22", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt items 137-145", "last_verified": "2026-10-22", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress", "marker": "march to a million: in progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true, "throttled": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Construction Jobs Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature Master Builder Path", "Signature Pay-Ladder Transparency"], "sibling_edition": "construction-jobs"}}
{"id": "JAH-CONJOB-S-000003", "slug": "construction-jobs-signature", "title": "Construction Jobs — Signature Pay-Ladder Transparency", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "construction job record", "ladder_rank": 4, "body": "Signature edition. Signature-original employment concept. Signature Pay-Ladder Transparency posts every pay step on the job trailer wall: apprentice steps, journeyman rate, lead premium, and the exact raise for each certification. Workers see what the next rung pays and what earns it. The Signature idea: transparent ladders keep good hands from leaving for a rumor of better pay. A Signature concept for study.", "capabilities": ["Post the full pay ladder", "Tie raises to certifications", "List the lead premium", "Audit ladder fairness yearly", "Use the ladder in hiring"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Signature ladder raise calculator", "code": "let p=C.base;for(const s of C.steps)p*=1+s;assert(Math.round(p)===C.expected,'ladder top');J({ladder_top:Math.round(p)});", "verified_output": "{\"ladder_top\":72037}", "verified_at": "2026-10-22", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt items 137-145", "last_verified": "2026-10-22", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress", "marker": "march to a million: in progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true, "throttled": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Construction Jobs Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature Master Builder Path", "Signature Trade-Swap Program"], "sibling_edition": "construction-jobs"}}
{"id": "JAH-CONJOB-S-000004", "slug": "construction-jobs-signature", "title": "Construction Jobs — Signature Safety Captain Role", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "construction job record", "ladder_rank": 6, "body": "Signature edition. Signature-original job concept. Every Signature crew names a rotating Safety Captain — a working crew member with explicit stop-work authority for that week. Duties: morning hazard huddle, PPE check, ladder and scaffold inspection, and the power to stop any task that looks unsafe, no questions asked. Rotation keeps the role fresh and spreads safety ownership across the crew. A Signature concept for study.", "capabilities": ["Run the morning hazard huddle", "Inspect ladders and scaffolds", "Exercise stop-work authority", "Rotate the captain weekly", "Log every stop-work event"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Signature captain rotation planner", "code": "const w=C.weeks/C.crew;assert(w===C.expected_weeks_per,'rotation');J({weeks_per_captain:w});", "verified_output": "{\"weeks_per_captain\":1}", "verified_at": "2026-10-22", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt items 137-145", "last_verified": "2026-10-22", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress", "marker": "march to a million: in progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true, "throttled": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Construction Jobs Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature Master Builder Path", "Signature Trade-Swap Program", "Signature Pay-Ladder Transparency"], "sibling_edition": "construction-jobs"}}
{"id": "JAH-CONJOB-S-000005", "slug": "construction-jobs-signature", "title": "Construction Jobs — Signature Tool-Ownership Plan", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "construction job record", "ladder_rank": 8, "body": "Signature edition. Signature-original employment concept. The Signature Tool-Ownership Plan helps apprentices build their own tool kit: the company matches every dollar the apprentice spends on approved tools, up to a yearly cap, and the tools stay the worker's property. A worker with their own sharp, familiar tools works faster and safer than one borrowing dull company tools. A Signature concept for study.", "capabilities": ["List the approved tool list", "Compute the company match", "Cap the yearly match", "Track tool ownership", "Explain the retention effect"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Signature tool match calculator", "code": "const m=Math.min(C.spent*C.match_rate,C.cap);assert(m===C.expected,'match');J({company_match:m});", "verified_output": "{\"company_match\":800}", "verified_at": "2026-10-22", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt items 137-145", "last_verified": "2026-10-22", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress", "marker": "march to a million: in progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true, "throttled": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Construction Jobs Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature Master Builder Path", "Signature Trade-Swap Program", "Signature Pay-Ladder Transparency"], "sibling_edition": "construction-jobs"}}
{"id": "JAH-CONJOB-S-000006", "slug": "construction-jobs-signature", "title": "Construction Jobs — Signature Mentor Pairing", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "construction job record", "ladder_rank": 10, "body": "Signature edition. Signature-original training concept. Signature Mentor Pairing matches every new hire with a journeyman mentor for the first 90 days, with a written checklist of skills to transfer: layout, tool maintenance, plan reading, and the trade's safety criticals. Mentors earn a premium while paired, so teaching is rewarded, not a burden. A Signature concept for study.", "capabilities": ["Match hires with mentors", "List the 90-day skill checklist", "Pay the mentor premium", "Review pairing at day 90", "Track retention of paired hires"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Signature mentorship tracker", "code": "const pct=Math.round(C.paired/C.hires*100);assert(pct===C.expected_pct,'pairing');J({paired_percent:pct});", "verified_output": "{\"paired_percent\":100}", "verified_at": "2026-10-22", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt items 137-145", "last_verified": "2026-10-22", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress", "marker": "march to a million: in progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true, "throttled": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Construction Jobs Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature Master Builder Path", "Signature Trade-Swap Program", "Signature Pay-Ladder Transparency"], "sibling_edition": "construction-jobs"}}
{"id": "JAH-CONJOB-S-000007", "slug": "construction-jobs-signature", "title": "Construction Jobs — Signature Retired-Hands Guild", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "construction job record", "ladder_rank": 12, "body": "Signature edition. Signature-original employment concept. The Signature Retired-Hands Guild keeps retired tradespeople in the system as part-time inspectors, estimators, and mentors. Their decades of pattern recognition — the sag that means a bad header, the stain that means a roof leak — get written into checklists instead of retiring with them. A Signature concept for study.", "capabilities": ["Recruit retired tradespeople", "Assign inspection and mentoring roles", "Capture pattern-recognition checklists", "Schedule part-time guild work", "Measure defect reduction"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Signature guild coverage estimator", "code": "const v=C.guild_members*C.visits_per_week;assert(v>=C.sites,'coverage');J({weekly_visits:v,sites_covered:C.sites});", "verified_output": "{\"weekly_visits\":10,\"sites_covered\":10}", "verified_at": "2026-10-22", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt items 137-145", "last_verified": "2026-10-22", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress", "marker": "march to a million: in progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true, "throttled": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Construction Jobs Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature Master Builder Path", "Signature Trade-Swap Program", "Signature Pay-Ladder Transparency"], "sibling_edition": "construction-